  native exit 0.
- The original affected compiler file executes all twenty cases with the
  explicit approved child-only GEM_HOME: twenty pass, none fail/skip, native
  exit 0. Its original compiler-output assertions remain unchanged.
- TypeScript checking exits 0 on the combined reviewed integration plus this
